OL,3,AEnding corridor care in hospitals for
OL,4,Achildren a priority, says health
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe health secretary has asked the NHS
OL,8,Fto draw up urgent plans to speed up
OL,9,Fending hospital "corridor care" for
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FYvette Cooper told the BBC there would
OL,13,Fbe new standards for caring for
OL,14,Fchildren in A&E in England, with
OL,15,Ffigures collected on corridor care by
OL,16,Fage for the first time.
OL,18,FShe was speaking on Sunday with Laura
OL,19,FKuenssberg where the programme
OL,20,Fhighlighted the case of two-year-old
OL,21,FFinlay Roberts who died in a hospital
OL,22,Fcorridor in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
